WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
OpenDuet product tour: sample workspace, simulated model and accounts.

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
Send a task and open the finished file in Make.

00:07.000 --> 00:12.500
Review the generated brief, download it or ask for changes.

00:12.500 --> 00:19.500
Review the exact memory update before approving it.

00:19.500 --> 00:22.760
The approved preference appears in Settings.
